# main-foco: the real main screen with the real keyboard group. The firmware's
# main_screen() registers its spectrum in keyboard_group through a 100 ms timer
# (keys_enable_cb in src/main_screen.c); with the group created up front the
# harness lets that timer fire on the virtual clock and then moves the focus with
# lv_group_focus_next(). It exercises the focus chain without hardware.
#
# The spectrum is the only main-screen widget in the group and it carries no
# focus style, so this render is pixel-identical to `main` today; the fixture
# keeps the chain reproducible until a focus-styled widget (Settings) is covered.
# See the coverage matrix in docs/AB_TESTING.md.

name main-foco
screen main-foco

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
